    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 04</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Manage FASTag and digital wallet balances effectively by freezing or deactivating auto-renewals if necessary. While the vehicle itself is in transit, associated digital services may still incur charges or require updates. Document the current balance and tag status to avoid unexpected deductions during the period when the vehicle is not in active use on public highways.</p>
