    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 05</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify all documentation and insurance coverage specific to the chosen mode. If opting for bike parcel by bus or a specialized motorcycle carrier, ensure the waybill explicitly mentions the vehicle details. Cross-reference this with your local bike parcel service near psg college or other regional providers to confirm that liability limits match the current market value of your two-wheeler.</p>
